# 12. THE PANTHEON SUBSYSTEM INTEGRATION
PRISM provides a shared backbone for existing
Pantheon capabilities.
SEMANTIC ALPHA
Controls visibility, attention, masks, and activation.
SEMANTIC PCA
Produces task-sensitive reduced representations
and reconstruction coordinates.
ABDUCTIVE REVERSIBILITY
Infers missing structures and source programs.
PAINTER'S ATELIER
Infers plausible brushstroke operations,
layer order, tools, and material behavior.
Its forward model tests candidate painting programs
against observed artifacts.
PRISM GUITAR
Maps image, text, narrative, culture, or other
structures into musical performance.
Preserves selected relational and temporal features.
Distinguishes abstract musical structure from
human technique, gesture, cultural transmission,
and instrument-specific embodiment.
Allows relational beauty to emerge from differences
between modalities rather than homogenizing them.
NARRATIVE TENSOR ARCHITECTURE
Represents characters, events, contexts,
perspectives, motifs, and state transitions.
THOUGHTOBJECT / STATEVECTOR
Provides stateful units of meaning, identity,
and transformation.
DELTA CALCULUS
Measures discrepancies and drives repair.
SEMANTIC LIDAR
Detects structural boundaries, hidden relations,
mismatches, and changes of resolution.
ADAPTIVE RESOLUTION MODULATION
Adjusts detail according to objective and budget.
GROWTH GRAMMAR
Defines how new structural complexity can emerge
through reusable operators.
CULTURAL SOVEREIGNTY MEMBRANE
Preserves culturally specific meanings,
ambiguities, untranslatable concepts,
and provenance under cross-cultural translation.
MOTHER DUCK LEDGER
Records invariants, deltas, decisions, provenance,
failures, and reconstruction instructions.
BOOTLOADER / PATTERN COMPLETION
Rehydrates useful runtime structures from
a compressed architectural seed.
Each subsystem shares the SRP contract.
Each may contribute operators, evaluators,
adapters, or hypotheses.
None is required to flatten the others
into its own representational language.
